{%- comment -%}
  Quali8 — Delivery checkout (cart page app block).

  A three-step pre-checkout: 1) Who's sending? (sender + recipient, or
  "sending to myself"), 2) Delivery / Pickup (delivery verifies the zip
  against the app's zones, then collects the address; pickup skips it),
  3) Summary with the Checkout button. Steps on the left, the form in the
  middle, an order summary on the right. Everything typed is saved to cart
  attributes as it changes, and Checkout opens Shopify's checkout with the
  recipient's shipping address prefilled. While the summary isn't complete
  the theme's own checkout and express-payment buttons are hidden.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- capture q8_dc_settings -%}
{
